# Company-name rule cases, written for this repository. Synthetic names only.
# lang|hints|input|article|base|form|elf|trading|careof|canonical
# form: the legal form as written; elf: the ELF code, ? when the form fits several codes, _ when there is no form; * means do not check.
# ELF codes are from the ISO 20275 list v1.6.
